# This repository is the *final coursework submission* folder, so the
# generated dataset (data/), the deterministic run outputs (runs/), and
# the report artefacts (artifacts/) are all tracked on purpose so the
# grader sees the reproduced numbers without having to re-run anything.
# The full pipeline can still be regenerated bit-for-bit with
# `make reset && make dataset && make eval-baseline && make search ROUNDS=4 SEED=7 && make report`.
